    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d45-a7-a3-a1">

                <pb facs="0106" n="96" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg96"/>

                <head>A.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Liverpool,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 30, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Messrs. M. G. Klingender &amp; Co. must request Mrs. Martha Latham, before paying
                    her the <hi rendition="#italic">£</hi>3 10<hi rendition="#italic">s.</hi> to
                    sign her name at the back of the allotment note, and then return it to them,
                    when they will remit her a money order for the amount, less cost of order.</p>
                <p>Mrs. <hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Latham</hi>,</p>
                <p>19 <hi rendition="#italic">Wellington street, Swansea, South Wales.</hi></p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>P. S.—Please note address, No. 22 Water street, Liverpool.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
